{"seq":3,"slug":"dns-loadbalancing","title":"DNS 与负载均衡","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/dns-loadbalancing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cloud-dns-architecture","title":"云 DNS 架构","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/dns-loadbalancing/cloud-dns-architecture","wordCount":1594,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"load-balancer-patterns","title":"负载均衡器模式","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/dns-loadbalancing/load-balancer-patterns","wordCount":1509,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-traffic-management","title":"全球流量管理","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/dns-loadbalancing/global-traffic-management","wordCount":1754,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# DNS 与负载均衡\n\nDNS 解析和负载均衡是网络流量从\"可达\"走向\"可用\"的关键环节。DNS 把人类可读的域名翻译成网络地址，而负载均衡器在多个后端之间分配请求以实现高可用和弹性扩缩。本章系统覆盖云原生 DNS 架构设计、四层/七层负载均衡器的选型与模式、以及全球流量管理与 Anycast 路由。\n\n三篇文档的关系是：DNS 架构提供名称解析基础设施；负载均衡器在单区域内做请求分发；全球流量管理则在区域之间做智能路由决策。三者组合起来，支撑了从单集群到全球多活的完整流量编排能力。\n"}